ction to serine via net nitrile hydrolysis", "description": "Hydrothermal reduction of glyoxal gives glycolaldehyde, which is then trapped in a concentrating prebiotic pool and converted to serine through Strecker chemistry and overall nitrile hydrolysis.", "reaction_sequence": ["rxn_002", "rxn_003", "rxn_004"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_004", "mol_008"]}, {"pathway_id": "P6", "name": "Hydrothermal glyoxal reduction to serine via serinamide", "description": "Vent-derived glycolaldehyde feeds the Strecker branch, with hydrolysis proceeding through the amide intermediate.", "reaction_sequence": ["rxn_002", "rxn_003", "rxn_005", "rxn_006"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_004", "mol_008", "mol_009"]}, {"pathway_id": "P7", "name": "Hydrothermal glyoxal reduction to serine via hydantoin overall hydrolysis", "description": "Vent-derived glycolaldehyde enters the hydantoin reservoir and is released directly as serine under stronger hydrolytic conditions.", "reaction_sequence": ["rxn_002", "rxn_007", "rxn_008"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_004", "mol_011"]}, {"pathway_id": "P8", "name": "Hydrothermal glyoxal reduction to serine via N-carbamylserine", "description": "The same hydrothermal glycolaldehyde entry is coupled to stepwise hydantoin hydrolysis through N-carbamylserine.", "reaction_sequence": ["rxn_002", "rxn_007", "rxn_009", "rxn_010"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_004", "mol_011", "mol_012"]}, {"pathway_id": "P9", "name": "Glycine nitrile homologation to serine via net nitrile hydrolysis", "description": "Formaldehyde first gives glycine nitrile by Strecker chemistry; homologation with formaldehyde yields serine nitrile, which then hydrolyzes overall to serine.", "reaction_sequence": ["rxn_011", "rxn_012", "rxn_004"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_013", "mol_008"]}, {"pathway_id": "P10", "name": "Glycine nitrile homologation to serine via serinamide", "description": "The lower-confidence glycine nitrile branch converges on serine nitrile and then reaches serine through explicit amide hydrolysis.", "reaction_sequence": ["rxn_011", "rxn_012", "rxn_005", "rxn_006"], "key_intermediates": ["mol_013", "mol_008", "mol_009"]}], "hub_molecules": ["mol_004", "mol_008", "mol_011"], "convergence_points": [{"molecule_id": "mol_004", "incoming_reactions": ["rxn_001", "rxn_002"], "outgoing_reactions": ["rxn_003", "rxn_007"]}, {"molecule_id": "mol_008", "incoming_reactions": ["rxn_003", "rxn_012"], "outgoing_reactions": ["rxn_004", "rxn_005"]}, {"molecule_id": "mol_011", "incoming_reactions": ["rxn_007"], "outgoing_reactions": ["rxn_008", "rxn_009"]}, {"molecule_id": "mol_014", "incoming_reactions": ["rxn_004", "rxn_006", "rxn_008", "rxn_010"], "outgoing_reactions": []}]}, "reasoning": "", "duration_ms": 587469.1967964172, "success": true, "error_message": null}
